# Synchronized Charge ({1}{G}): "Distribute two +1/+1 counters among one or two target creatures you control. Creatures you control with counters on them gain vigilance and trample until end of turn." Bot1 splits one counter each between Memnite and Llanowar Elves (CR 601.2d: no target at all, a share of 0 and Bot2's Walking Ballista are refused, with the mana there), so both become 2/2 and 2/2 with vigilance and trample; its Ornithopter, with no counter, gains nothing and keeps only its flying; Bot2's Walking Ballista, which entered with two +1/+1 counters, gains nothing: only creatures you control count.

